    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A base building &amp; farming game with survival elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a farm that grows resources. Then use those resources to build and expand your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft new tools, unlock more land, and build new machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Defend your base at night time from monsters that come out of the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 crops to grow and farm for resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 items &amp; buildings to craft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat &amp; base defense during night time</p></li></ul>",
